=00_Afsc9H6bMt8MqCByhqZEhMaAx06ejrPH2HsbCTaeKM2SUw&oe=699D8C1E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "247096786454689", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_132381304133910_8499134903143628800_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VNuxflMG7GUQ7kNvwGdyR0t&_nc_oc=AdlGFZedtwsPYkCdKT7dnhOHXwzTaEgytjBznySQnEkTdeFksOQ5HytqZsneqTG1rxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxTKSA3VCwev8G307Zh7SwCLkrh5T38Q7aEASXgMJEKA&oe=699D84A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "coco_video_7.png", "id": "138276410159384", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162696_138276413492717_1494748721810767872_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c6iGo--Wp2YQ7kNvwEakUpF&_nc_oc=AdlMOC4GF-ZNula764_I5uPuH3d-_MJk2oLb5eniqrYrbzp-nc6kCM1t_ASw1zqdaUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft89ntle-oC0YnIdrOz2_aL9yhfXvTia6bHwugEu4C08Q&oe=699DB0ED"}, "display_name": "Coco VR", "keywords": ["Coco", "VR", "Disney", "Pixar", "Oculus"], "long_description": "Coco VR is Pixar\u2019s stunning debut into virtual reality: an adventure into the beautiful Disney-Pixar film, Coco, coming to theaters November 22.  \n\nFollow the magical alebrije into the luminous world of Coco filled with lovable characters and beautiful settings from the film.\n\nFEATURES\n* Meet Miguel, Ceci, and Hector in fascinating locations featured in the movie.\n* Express your uniqueness and rock a new style in Ceci\u2019s costume shop.\n* Take a gondola ride and see the gorgeous city from above.\n* Live a little in the spotlight!  You\u2019re the star alongside of Hector in a musical celebration of Dia de los Muertos!", "short_description": "Introducing Pixar Animation Studios\u2019 first VR experience with the visual - and storytelling - magic only Pixar could produce. You and your friends will explore the world of Disney\u2022Pixar's newest film, Coco, in this social VR experience."}]}, "develop